)F FUNCTION -
   The LISTP command lists one or more RAKF profiles.                            
   It lists the profiles and the classes and their access                        
   list.                                                                         
                                                                                 
 )X SYNTAX -                                                                     
   LISTP profile                                                                 
                                                                                 
   REQUIRED - profile, this can be a single profile or a list of                 
              profiles if a beginning part is specified.                         
              Example: LISTP SYS, lists all profiles starting with               
                       'SYS'.                                                    
                                                                                 
   RETURN CODES:                                                                 
                                                                                 
      0 - The profile(s) were listed.                                            
      8 - An error occurs. A suitable message will be given to                   
          the user.                                                              
                                                                                 
   SPECIAL REQUIREMENTS:                                                         
                                                                                 
      The issuing user should have the SPECIAL authority.                        
                                                                                 
 )O OPERANDS -                                                                   
 ))PROFILE - the profile(s) to list. 1 to 44 characters. Required,               
   and is the first and only operand. If the profile don't exist, a              
   suitable message will be displayed.                                           
                                                                                                                                                              
